<title>JAPAN: Ricoh Elemex - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ricoh Elemex - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 26.78		vs	   22.65</p>
<p> Operating	  968 million	 vs	  886 million</p>
<p> Current		1.17		vs	    1.12</p>
<p> Net		  652 million	 vs	  624 million</p>
<p> EPS		   31.65 yen	  vs	   30.28 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     21 million	  vs	  21 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    4.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Ricoh Elemex Corp is involved in the development, manufacture and selling of watches.</p>
</text>
